WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.449
Welcome back, little explorer!

2
00:00:03.399 --> 00:00:05.625
Ollie Owl here.

3
00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:09.115
Today we learn about counting together!

4
00:00:10.268 --> 00:00:12.230
Are you ready?

5
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.756
Let's find out together!

6
00:00:16.124 --> 00:00:17.811
Look!

7
00:00:17.761 --> 00:00:19.819
This is ONE.

8
00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.975
One means just a single thing.

9
00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:24.941
One apple!

10
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.751
Which one is ONE?

11
00:00:32.952 --> 00:00:37.048
Remember: One means just a single thing.

12
00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:38.964
One apple!

13
00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.007
Look!

14
00:00:41.957 --> 00:00:44.091
This is TWO.

15
00:00:44.091 --> 00:00:46.378
Two means a pair.

16
00:00:46.378 --> 00:00:48.787
You have two hands!

17
00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.794
Can you say TWO with me?

18
00:00:52.744 --> 00:00:54.756
Let's try!

19
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.631
Wow!

20
00:01:00.581 --> 00:01:03.386
You learned so much today.

21
00:01:03.386 --> 00:01:05.932
I am so proud of you!

22
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.031
Great job, my friend!

23
00:01:09.981 --> 00:01:13.273
Come back soon and we'll learn more.

24
00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:15.011
Bye bye!

25
00:01:16.068 --> 00:01:19.722
Try "Colors All Around Us" next!
